WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.299
"Let's make something," said Cow.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.304
"What can we make?" asked Dog.

3
00:00:10.305 --> 00:00:13.835
"Farmer makes snowmen," said Cow.

4
00:00:13.836 --> 00:00:16.960
"We can make snow friends."

5
00:00:16.961 --> 00:00:20.693
"Show us how, Cow," said Pig.

6
00:00:20.694 --> 00:00:24.118
"Okay," said Cow.

7
00:00:24.119 --> 00:00:30.603
She made a snowball.

8
00:00:30.604 --> 00:00:35.270
Cat and Pig picked up snow.

9
00:00:35.271 --> 00:00:39.315
They made snowballs too.

10
00:00:39.316 --> 00:00:43.506
Soon Dog was helping.

11
00:00:43.507 --> 00:00:54.350
The snowballs grew.

12
00:00:54.351 --> 00:00:56.996
The friends put ears on them.

13
00:00:56.997 --> 00:00:59.667
They put mouths on them.

14
00:00:59.668 --> 00:01:02.527
They put eyes on them.

15
00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:05.494
They put noses on them.

16
00:01:05.495 --> 00:01:08.573
They made . . .

17
00:01:08.574 --> 00:01:16.820
Snow Cow, Snow Cat, Snow Dog, and Snow Pig!

18
00:01:16.821 --> 00:01:47.130
"Let's make one more!" said Dog.

19
00:01:47.131 --> 00:01:52.399
"Look, Bat," said Cat. "It's . . ."

20
00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:57.346
"Snow Bat!" said Bat.

21
00:01:57.347 --> 00:02:00.155
"Yes," said Dog.

22
00:02:00.156 --> 00:02:09.620
"We are snow friends!"

